.Dd July 17, 2026
.Dt RETICULUM-GO-DEBUG 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm reticulum-go-debug
.Nd dump effective config and RPC diagnostics
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm reticulum-go Cm debug
.Op Fl config Ar path
.Op Fl json
.Op Fl rates
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Prints config path, log level, platform, and shared-instance RPC reachability.
.Sh FLAG PARSING
Flags may appear before, between, or after positional arguments. A literal
.Cm --
ends flag parsing. The
.Fl config
option accepts a config file or a directory. A directory uses the file named
config inside it.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr reticulum-go 1 ,
.Xr reticulum-go-status 1
